### ==========================================
### 权限码管理 — Auth Code（历史兼容）
### 路径前缀：/auth-code
### 旧版权限码管理，新版建议使用 menu 模块管理 BUTTON 类型权限
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 权限码列表 -------------------
### @name List Auth Codes
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth-code/list HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 创建权限码 -------------------
### @name Create Auth Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth-code/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "system:report:export",
  "name": "导出报表",
  "status": 1
}

### ------------------- 更新权限码 -------------------
### @name Update Auth Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth-code/update?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "导出报表（已修改）"
}

### ------------------- 删除权限码 -------------------
### @name Delete Auth Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth-code/delete?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
